<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AutoZone raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AutoZone raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded AutoZone Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Darren Kimball cited in a report a &quot;belief that significant sector consolidation is afoot.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Set a six-month price target of $29 on the stock, which was up 1/4 at 24-5/8.</p>
</text>
